                </span>
                <span class="requirement-copy">
                  <strong>Experiencia en funciones similares</strong>
                  <small>Trayectoria relacionada detectada en el CV.</small>
                </span>
                <span class="requirement-result">
                  <b class="priority priority-critical">Crítica</b>
                  <em>Coincidencia alta</em>
                </span>
              </article>

              <article class="requirement-row match-positive">
                <span class="requirement-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="requirement-copy">
                  <strong>Atención al cliente</strong>
                  <small>Experiencia directa en entornos de servicio.</small>
                </span>
                <span class="requirement-result">
                  <b class="priority priority-high">Alta</b>
                  <em>Coincidencia alta</em>
                </span>
              </article>

              <article class="requirement-row match-review">
                <span class="requirement-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M12 8v5M12 16h.01" /></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="requirement-copy">
                  <strong>Disponibilidad</strong>
                  <small>La información necesita confirmación del candidato.</small>
                </span>
                <span class="requirement-result">
                  <b class="priority priority-medium">Media</b>
                  <em>Pendiente</em>
                </span>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>
        </article>
      </div>

      <footer class="selection-bar">
        <div class="selection-summary">
          <span class="selection-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" /><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" /><path d="m17 11 2 2 4-4" /></svg>
